      <title><![CDATA[Torrijas: de pan duro a postre de Semana Santa]]></title>
      <description><![CDATA[This post is for you if you’ve heard about torrijas but you’re not really sure what they are or why they’re so typical at Easter in Spain.]]></description>
      <link>https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/torrijas-de-pan-duro-a-postre-de</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">post:192346588</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 04 Apr 2026 05:07:48 GMT</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <substacker:source>export</substacker:source>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>This is written in Spanish on purpose. You don’t need to understand every word; just keep reading.</strong></p><p>Here’s what you’ll find inside: a quick intro to what <em>torrijas</em> are, an easy recipe, a fun colloquial bonus, and a mini quiz to test your Spanish. </p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Estamos en plena Semana Santa y, en España, eso significa una cosa muy importante: <strong>comer torrijas</strong>, el postre típico de estas fechas.​</p><p>Las mejores, sin duda, eran las que hacía mi abuela. Yo la ayudaba a echar el azúcar y la canela justo después de sacarlas de la sartén, todavía calientes, para que el pan absorbiera bien la mezcla. Solo de pensarlo, ya me entra hambre.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h07v!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h07v!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h07v!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h07v!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h07v!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg" width="1200" height="1600" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1600,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:223488,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/i/192346588?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h07v!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h07v!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h07v!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h07v!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b02b50-272c-4504-9c19-a55acfb50afe_1200x1600.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Foto de mi amiga <a href="https://www.instagram.com/folkandflow00?igsh=MTAwbmlsazVsMDhidw==">Nuria</a></p><p>Las torrijas son un postre de aprovechamiento: se usa pan duro del día anterior (o de varios días), que se empapa en leche con canela, se pasa por huevo y se fríe en aceite. Después, se rebozan en azúcar y canela. Imposible que eso esté malo. De si son saludables o no… ahí ya no voy a meterme 🙃</p><p>Es una receta humilde, barata, muy calórica y perfecta para épocas de escasez o de abstinencia de carne. (Cuaresma / Semana Santa)</p><p>Por si te animas, aquí va una versión muy resumida de la receta:</p><ol><li><p>Corta el pan en rebanadas.</p></li><li><p>Empapa el pan en leche con canela.</p></li><li><p>Pasa el pan por huevo.</p></li><li><p>Fríe en la sartén y añade azúcar y canela por encima.</p></li><li><p>Y a disfrutar. ¡Que aproveche!</p></li></ol><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cf3v!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cf3v!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cf3v!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cf3v!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cf3v!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg 1456w" sizes="auto, 100vw"><img src="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg" width="1200" height="1600" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1600,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:377989,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/i/192346588?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cf3v!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cf3v!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cf3v!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cf3v!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b264e97-8747-4a73-aa75-a8a84116b621_1200x1600.jpeg 1456w" sizes="auto, 100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Foto de mi amiga <a href="https://www.instagram.com/folkandflow00?igsh=MTAwbmlsazVsMDhidw==">Nuria</a></p><p><strong>Bonus coloquial:</strong> en España, <em>torrija</em> no es solo el postre. De forma coloquial, la RAE recoge también el significado de <strong>borrachera / efecto de emborracharse</strong>, y expresiones como <em>“Vaya torrija llevas”</em> o <em>“cogerse una torrija”</em> significan “ponerse muy borracho”</p><h2><strong>Quiz mini </strong></h2><ol><li><p>¿En qué época del año se comen <strong>tradicionalmente</strong> las torrijas en España?<br>a) Antes de Semana Santa<br>b) En Semana Santa<br>c) Después de Semana Santa</p></li><li><p>¿Cuál de estos ingredientes NO es típico en la receta clásica de torrijas?<br>a) Pan del día anterior<br>b) Leche<br>c) Tomate</p></li><li><p>Completa la frase según el artículo:<br>“Las torrijas son un postre perfecto para…”<br>a) Aprovechar el pan que sobra<br>b) Comer más verduras<br>c) Evitar el azúcar</p></li></ol><div class="subscription-widget-wrap-editor" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}" data-component-name="SubscribeWidgetToDOM"><div class="subscription-widget show-subscribe"><div class="preamble"><p class="cta-caption">Thanks for reading Daily Push(es)! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class="subscription-widget-subscribe"><input type="email" class="email-input" name="email" placeholder="Type your email…" tabindex="-1"><input type="submit" class="button primary" value="Subscribe"><div class="fake-input-wrapper"><div class="fake-input"></div><div class="fake-button"></div></div></form></div></div><p>Soluciones: b, c, a. </p><p>Y hasta aquí el artículo de hoy 😊</p><p>Ms Myriam</p>]]></content:encoded>
